                       "bubbles-follow" the village's bubbles with their people (QA's hook "hour:11"): at home, dragged
                       so some are off screen, zoomed in and dragged, the edge chip ("‹ 🐑 2") tapped and its bubble on
                       screen then;
                       "visit-sky" on a visit by the clock's night (never under QA's hook "hour:<h>": the real sky is
                       drawn by the clock only), the moon tapped where the picture has it (the largest round bright spot
                       of the sky in a screenshot), else its brightest stars: the sky card in the town's language explained
                       in the visitor's base, neither "📚" nor "📖" on it (a visit of its own when none goes on; in
