                       greetings in its own store (LANI_DEV_TOWN_VOICES), the dev bridge an Italian learner's (LANI_DEV_DATA,
                       else a synthetic one from German, Friuli, made in the run's folder; setup in sl · en) with a fake
                       ElevenLabs and no local voice worker, the phone without a Slovene voice (QA's hooks "audio:tts:off",
                       "audio:voice:remove:sl", "audio:visitvoice:reset"), the visit in it · de (LANI_QA_VISIT_PAIR): a
                       greeting the town has a clip of plays it (tag Speaker "node clip", the dev bridge "the town's own
                       clip"), a line it has none of is voiced on the dev bridge ("voiced here (elevenlabs)", the fake's take
