                       obiske (61 MB)?"), "Ne zdaj", the town again: "🔇 Ta naprava nima glasu za slovenščino" with "⬇️
                       Prenesi", downloaded, the next line said by it (Speaker "offline voice", Piper's WAV); the lines in
