                       "scroll" the village's scroll: its count on the bottom bar (what's new only), its grid of four
                       collections and the chronicle's newest line, each collection's list and back, a grammar page in
                       the sheet's look, the count cleared once it was open, the grid in German (QA's hook "pair:sl-de");
                       "exercise-words" a review's words looked up (QA's hook "forms"): a tap on a word of the
                       sentence with the gap opens its card, a long press on a form to choose (what's tested) opens
